So you source data from some place.

83
00:05:34,881 --> 00:05:37,872
you usually have some batch
data processing pipeline.

84
00:05:37,875 --> 00:05:39,131
You have streams.

85
00:05:39,766 --> 00:05:46,056
And, and the feature store inside has two
